  "substitutions": [
    "Explicit optional permission-cache lookup result at101ae4108; original101af7720 chooses its inline/heap/absent view.",
    "Explicit DSA property presence/boolean and list-player input; no runtime default or account permission is inferred.",
    "Standard containers, strings, streams and locale reuse existing OriginalQuery primitives; original protobuf serializer is not replaced.",
    "Standard libc vsnprintf for the executed spotify:playlist:%s form uses host snprintf; original URI parser/formatter decisions remain unchanged.",
    "Opaque HTTP template/setter/property/context/callback interfaces record supplied arguments and stop before send."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Requested lenses are explicit request-context inputs; this does not infer actual liked-write context defaults.",
    "Synthetic ListChanges fields test body installation/serialization, not the separate original Add/Rem producer semantics.",
    "Inherited headers/origin are synthetic; final native app headers, origin selection and transport framing need independent authority.",
    "No live write, remote acknowledgement, retry or cache mutation is exercised."
  ],
